{"id":"H6644","lemma":"צִבְיָא","transliteration":"tsivya","sayIt":"tsiv-YA","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Zibia","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.8.9;\nson of: Shaharaim (H7842) and Hodesh (H2321);\nbrother of: Jobab (H3103J), Mesha (H4331), Malcam (H4445A), Jeuz (H3263), Sachia (H7634), Mirmah (H4821), Abitub (H0036) and Elpaal (H0508)\n§ Zibia = \"roe\"\na Benjamite, son of Shaharaim by wife Hodesh","glosses":["zibia"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"Zibia","kjv":"and Zibia"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 8:9","note":"By Hodesh his wife, he became the father of Jobab, Zibia, Mesha, Malcam,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0036","lemma":"אֲבִיטוּב","transliteration":"avituv","gloss":"Abitub"},{"id":"H0508","lemma":"אֶלְפַּ֫עַל","transliteration":"elpaal","gloss":"Elpaal"},{"id":"H2321","lemma":"חֹ֫דֶשׁ","transliteration":"chodesh","gloss":"Hodesh"},{"id":"H3103","lemma":"יוֹבָב","transliteration":"yovav","gloss":"Jobab"},{"id":"H3263","lemma":"יְעוּץ","transliteration":"yeuts","gloss":"Jeuz"},{"id":"H4331","lemma":"מֵישָׁא","transliteration":"mesah","gloss":"Mesha"},{"id":"H4445","lemma":"מַלְכָּם","transliteration":"malkam","gloss":"Malcam"},{"id":"H4821","lemma":"מִרְמָה","transliteration":"mirmah","gloss":"Mirmah"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}